WEBVTT

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.330
"Before the H Age"

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.790
"Emergency Government Broadcast"

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:27.500
"Emergency Government Broadcast"
"Head, Party of Words | Otome Tohoten"

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.660
Good evening, fellow citizens.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:35.830
I am Otome Tohoten, head of the Party of Words.

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:40.040
I imagine this unexpected broadcast
comes as a surprise to you.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.160
Still, I have an important announcement to make.

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:50.950
I hereby declare that the Party of Words
has now assumed control of the government.

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:56.370
This is a hypnosis mic,
a special mic that we developed.

00:00:56.370 --> 00:01:02.290
Words passing through it will cause
listeners to suffer various misfortunes.

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:04.160
Existing weapons are hereby abolished,

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:09.620
and all conflicts will be
settled by battles using these mics.

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.120
We have now entered an age in
which words have the ultimate power.

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:17.580
"Emergency Government Broadcast"
"Head, Party of Words | Otome Tohoten"

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:17.580
Accordingly, the Party of Words hereby
declares that the H Law is now in effect.

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:19.080
"H Law Summary"
"Manufacture of deadly weapons prohibited"
"Existing weapons to be destroyed"

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.790
The manufacture of all
deadly weapons is hereby prohibited...

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:26.700
...and all existing weapons will be destroyed.

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:30.450
Instead of foolish, warmongering men,

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:33.700
women will be the ones
to give the world a fresh start.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.450
"H Age: Year 3"

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:28.830
What's that Tenderloins member
doing going into a place like this?

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:33.040
Beats me. Maybe that's
why we got this request.

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:37.660
But something's not right if their leader
wants us to tail one of his own crew.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:40.790
Different teams have
different dynamics, I guess.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:48.000
Well, just tailing people is a real cakewalk.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.620
What? It's that kind of careless
thinking that leads to slip-ups.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:52.660
Hmph!

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:55.330
Normally I can handle
this kind of job on my own.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:59.580
But I graciously paired up with a
dimwit like you not because I wanted to,

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:01.660
but because Brother Ichi asked me to.
So just stay out of my way.

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:05.120
Big Bro had me come along
because you're such a wimp.

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:09.620
Who needs you? If you're really one of
my big brothers, why don't you act like one?

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:10.790
What'd you say?

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:12.080
Oh!

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:14.700
Damn it!

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:17.200
We lost him, and it's all your fault!

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:20.160
It's your fault for saying stuff to piss me off!

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:21.410
We've got to hurry up and follow him!

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:24.080
Tsk... Wait for me, Saburo!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:32.700
This is the only place
he could possibly have gone into.

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.830
I don't see him anywhere...

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:38.290
Huh?!

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:39.580
What's going on?

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:41.790
Hahahaha.

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:44.540
You suckers played right into my hands.

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:47.370
Huh? What do you mean,
"played into your hands"?

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:51.040
My plan to crush the Buster Bros!!!

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.750
Tsk!

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:56.910
Damn.

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:58.700
There's too many of them...

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:04.330
Right about now, your big brother is
all alone getting his ass kicked by our crew.

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:07.830
Brother Ichi... Brother Ichi'd never lose!

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:11.250
There's no way he could
beat 30 guys all by himself.

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:13.790
He'd be a freak if he could.

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:23.080
Well, excuse me for being a freak!

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:23.830
Big Bro!

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:25.580
Brother Ichi!

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:29.750
Sorry to keep you two waiting.

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:34.200
I knew you wouldn't lose, Big Bro,
even if all those punks ganged up on you!

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:38.200
Scum like them are no match for you!

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:40.700
Y-You've gotta be shitting me...

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:44.200
Jiro, Saburo... Let's go!

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:45.790
--Yeah!
--OK!

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:57.750
♪ Buster Bros!!! ♪

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.040
♪ Look down on me, and be prepared for a penalty ♪

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:00.870
♪ Let's go! ♪

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:03.160
♪ The memoirs of 'bukuro can't be missed ♪

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:05.620
♪ Ichiro presenting a thousand hits ♪

00:06:05.620 --> 00:06:07.160
♪ Hey yo, you ready for this? ♪

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:09.700
♪ Goin' up against me is gonna be a real calamity ♪

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:11.250
♪ A serious tragedy ♪

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:13.080
♪ No use plugging your ears
to run from that reality ♪

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:13.580
♪ What's up? ♪

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:14.870
♪ You came all this way for a beat down? ♪

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:16.540
♪ Well, gather 'round
For a warm welcome ♪

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:18.200
♪ Now wait, lemme give you a summary: ♪

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:19.830
♪ All you players and wannabes ♪

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:21.080
♪ You're knockin' on heaven's door ♪

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:23.500
♪ You can go kickin' and screamin',
but you're headed down the stairway to hell ♪

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.950
♪ Shut up, idiots
My patience is at its limit ♪

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:28.120
♪ Hmm...
I see you're putting on an act ♪

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:29.620
♪ But it's seriously lacking impact ♪

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:31.080
♪ You've got some real guts to think you'd be safe ♪

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.750
♪ Walking through Ikebukuro gates ♪

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:34.370
♪ Yeah, yeah, you got just one fate ♪

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:35.870
♪ You're gonna get what's coming to you ♪

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.500
♪ When I attend your asinine display ♪

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.250
♪ I'll bomb you with rhymes instead of a bouquet! ♪

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:42.540
♪ We'll bust through all the cannon fodder! ♪

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:45.540
♪ And slice up whatever remains ♪

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:46.830
♪ This grind's got no end in sight ♪

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:48.500
♪ Annihilation's the best course of action ♪

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:51.080
♪ Don't leave a single one upright ♪

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:52.540
♪ Good job! ♪

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:04.620
All right, let's go home and eat!

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:06.160
OK!

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:15.450
That was Buster Bros!!!, a promising
team from the Ikebukuro Division.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:21.120
The team is distinctive for its synergy
owing to their strong, brotherly ties.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:22.450
Particularly noteworthy
is their leader Ichiro Yamada.

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:25.080
"Ichiro Yamada" "Jiro Yamada" "Saburo Yamada"

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:25.080
Particularly noteworthy
is their leader Ichiro Yamada.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:28.790
"Ichiro Yamada" "Jiro Yamada" "Saburo Yamada"

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:28.790
Indeed. He was a member of...

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:30.790
The Dirty Dawg...

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:36.870
Yes. The four members of that
team each had special abilities.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.120
Breaking them up was the right thing to do.

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:44.000
What are the other ex-members up to,
now that the land is divided into divisions?

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.080
They are active in their divisions
just like Ichiro Yamada.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.620
"Matenro"

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.620
They are active in their divisions
just like Ichiro Yamada.

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:54.620
It appears the division battle
will be more heated than I had imagined.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:58.700
I am certain of it. Next, we have Yokohama.

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:24.160
Target confirmed. I will meet up with you there.

00:08:29.160 --> 00:08:31.830
This is some good stuff you got here.

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:33.830
Hope to have the pleasure
of doing business with you again.

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:35.620
What the--?

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:45.950
You've got a lot of balls doing
a drug deal under my jurisdiction.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:53.500
Utashiro, you know that the
drug racket is off limits, don't you?

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:56.870
A-Aniki, what are you doing here...

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:01.000
I don't need a fucking reason.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:03.200
L-Let's get the fuck outta here!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:05.500
What the--?

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.330
What the hell's going on?

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:08.950
That road is closed.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:10.370
What the fuck?

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:15.000
A military man like me can improvise
explosive devices in his sleep.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.410
I've cut your line of retreat.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:21.410
Oh dear, looks like I'm going to have
to charge you with property damage as well...

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:23.540
F-Fucking ridiculous...

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:28.410
Utashiro, how the fuck are you
gonna make good on this, huh?

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:32.330
Damn! We've gotta fight our
way outta this! Fucking bastards!

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:39.330
Oh my, resisting arrest now, are you?
The charges against you will only increase.

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:41.370
You're going to take on
a member of the armed forces?

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:44.080
I hope you're adequately prepared for it.

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:47.000
Hahaha! Bring it on!

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:52.750
I'll teach you fucking maggots
to know your place!

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:14.580
♪ I'm a gangster, threatening a major disaster ♪

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:16.000
♪ While you're just some scrawny hamster ♪

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.250
♪ With that dopey look on your face ♪

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:19.620
♪ An utter disgrace
Fit for extermination ♪

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:22.120
♪ In the gangsta world, courage is key ♪

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:24.040
♪ And this flea's just what you don't wanna be ♪

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:25.410
♪ What a joke
I'll lend you a hand ♪

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:27.000
♪ And help you rebrand ♪

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.080
♪ By taking you out to sea
For the sharks to dine on for free ♪

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:31.120
♪ Not satisfied?
Then you can keep the pigs company ♪

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:32.830
♪ Night after night in this town ♪

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:34.500
♪ I see these cocky clowns
Peddling product by the ounce ♪

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.250
♪ Streets filled by post-war thugs ♪

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:38.120
♪ Rotting slum scum ♪

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:41.250
♪ But if you really wanna catch my eye
You better serve it with a side of crime ♪

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:43.000
♪ Guarding a syndicate VIP ♪

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:46.120
♪ Without any firepower to speak of
But my mission will succeed ♪

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:47.410
♪ Always ready for action, I guarantee ♪

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:48.950
♪ I foresee
Eliminating the threat ahead of me ♪

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:50.660
♪ With a mic headshot simultaneously ♪

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:55.330
♪ Gang, police, and navy
All together, nah mean? ♪

00:10:55.330 --> 00:11:00.000
♪ Trash justice has no place with us
three 'cause we're thuggy refugees ♪

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:05.000
♪ Gang, police, and navy
All together, nah mean? ♪

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:07.410
♪ Sick rhymes
All the time ♪

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:10.660
♪ Know what that means? ♪

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:28.870
All right, you can take it from here.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:31.370
Yessir!

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:34.160
You're not gonna get any thanks from me, Jyuto.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:36.000
Hmph, that's all right.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:39.750
I merely acted to fulfill my own objectives.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:41.250
Hmph.

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:48.250
D'oh!

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:50.660
Say, are you hungry?

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:53.250
Let me treat you to something at my base.

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:58.080
Today I've caught some delicious
moth larva, vipers, and longhorn beetles.

00:11:58.080 --> 00:11:59.580
You're in for a feast.

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:02.290
Uh, no, what you just heard was...

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:04.580
Why is your stomach growling, dipshit?

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:07.410
It seems I've been having some trouble
with indigestion since this morning.

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:09.370
In that case, I'll fix you
some soup using the larva.

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:11.160
They're an excellent source of protein.

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:12.080
I appreciate the gesture, but...

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.620
I had something to eat before I came here, so...

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:29.200
Ah!

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:33.080
Hold on, I'm coming!

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:35.500
Hey there, Gentaro, I've been expecting you!

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.660
Now, now, come in, come in!

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:39.160
Forgive the intrusion.

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:47.540
So, thou hast asked us
to assemble as quickly as possible.

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:48.700
Pray tell, what is thy business?

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:53.750
Tee-hee! I asked you here to hang out with me.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:56.330
Well then, I shall return
to my writing. Farewell.

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.870
Please don't go, pretty please!

00:12:58.870 --> 00:13:01.500
Hey guys, I have something
important to discuss with you.

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:06.410
What exquisite timing! Ramuda also
has some serious business with thee.

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:10.450
Hey there, Dice! Why so glum?

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:12.700
Nuohhhhhh!

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:16.750
I'm down on my hands and knees!
Would you please lend me some money?

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:17.790
Ahahaha!

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:22.410
I'm begging you... I blew it all playing
the slot machines. Now I'm flat broke...

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:26.000
Hmm... As much as I would like to,

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:29.700
I too lost my fortune gambling
and have not a yen to lend thee.

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:34.040
No way! If you were going,
you should've brought me along with you!

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.410
'Twas but a lie.

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:40.330
I would never do something so foolish.

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:42.790
Hey, you make it seem like I'm a fool.

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:45.500
I don't make it seem that way. Thou <i>art </i>a fool.

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:46.290
D'oh!

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:50.580
And if my memory serves me right,

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:54.330
thou hast not yet returned
the money I lent thee last week,

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:58.750
so I'm just a wee bit leery
of lending thee more.

00:13:58.750 --> 00:13:59.500
Grrr...

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:02.250
Dice, what are you gonna use the money for?

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:05.160
What do you think? My gut tells me
I'm sure to win next time,

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:07.410
so I need it for seed money!

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:09.620
That makes me even
more leery of giving him a loan.

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:12.750
OK, OK! I have a good idea!

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:15.160
What's your good idea?

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:19.830
We can't do it here.
So, let's go outside, everyone!

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:21.660
"Shibuya Center Street"

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:26.700
Pray tell, what is this good idea?

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:27.040
"DONATIONS, PLEASE!"

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:28.620
Ta-da!

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:31.160
If I could earn money just
by leaving a donation box,

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:32.790
I wouldn't be having such a hard time.

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:36.000
Of course, we aren't gonna
just leave it here, silly!

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.330
♪ This is a Shibuya guerilla jam session ♪

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:51.910
♪ Yeah! It's time to start
the lyrical fashion show ♪

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:56.660
♪ What? "Seriously?" Yes, really!
Mad hype for illusion and magic! ♪

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.290
--Hey, isn't that Ramuda?
--♪ It's a block party, like, totally! ♪

00:14:58.290 --> 00:14:58.870
--It sure is! C'mon, let's go!
--♪ It's a block party, like, totally! ♪

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.330
--It sure is! C'mon, let's go!
--♪ No expense spared at the Ramuda Laboratory ♪

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:03.330
♪ Love logic! It's the source of positivity ♪

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:04.540
♪ Ending with a ridiculous apogee ♪

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:05.700
♪ Hold me tight! ♪

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:07.620
♪ Demon slayer Momotaro? ♪

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:10.290
♪ No, 'tis I, Gentaro ♪

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:12.790
♪ A humble novelist, with a dog and monkey in tow ♪

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:14.790
♪ Filling up four verses like
a consummate professional ♪

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:15.790
♪ Oh ♪

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:17.080
♪ Well, I'm deep in the hole ♪

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.330
♪ Guess it's this stray dog's turn
to make the rhymes roll ♪

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:20.500
♪ Jackpot means it's time to party ♪

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:21.660
♪ Just like any other victory ♪

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:23.500
♪ Winnings piled high to the ceiling--cha-ching! ♪

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:25.580
♪ You know the drill ♪

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:27.450
♪ In the lit streets ♪

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:28.370
♪ Coffee and Chill ♪

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:29.500
♪ Success is a necessity ♪

00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:31.660
♪ But we're struggling through
this strategy meeting ♪

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.040
♪ Disjointed as a team ♪

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:34.790
♪ Time ticks away pointlessly ♪

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:37.040
♪ Moving ever more swiftly ♪

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.290
♪ What else would you expect from us three? ♪

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:40.830
♪ But we're having fun, what more do you need? ♪

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.950
♪ (Hoo! Yeah, yeah, yeah... Hahaha...) ♪

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:53.830
Heh... There's a shitload of money in here!

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:57.950
Wow! When did all these people show up?

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:01.330
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:05.080
Heh heh heh.

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:07.450
Dice, we're getting the hell out of here!

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:12.450
Ahaha! I'm over here!

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:15.450
Wah! M-My money!

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:21.370
Ahahaha! Catch me if you can!

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:31.250
"Kabukicho Ichibangai"

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:34.200
"Shinjuku Central Hospital"

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:38.790
There appear to be many police officers around.

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:41.040
Doctor, haven't you heard?

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:42.750
It seems the patient that
was brought in last night

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:46.330
is an anti-Party of Words terrorist.

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:48.120
"Matenro | Jakurai Jinguji"

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:52.330
Even in this world, it appears
we cannot possibly hope for peace.

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:53.290
What?

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:56.370
Oh... it's nothing.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:57.290
Hello.

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:59.200
H-Hello...

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:03.790
Oh, I'm terribly sorry, but you've
come outside our consultation hours...

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:05.910
Oh, my!

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:07.540
How lovely you are... Perhaps you
wouldn't mind coming by my club?

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:11.620
"Matenro | Hifumi Izanami"

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:14.040
My little kitten...

00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:19.620
I, the #1 host in Shinjuku,
will give you a night you'll never forget.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:21.830
A-All right...

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:22.950
Huh?!

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:27.290
"Matenro | Doppo Kannonzaka"

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:27.290
Hey, you're making
things hard for the doctor!

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:28.500
D'oh!

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:29.830
Wha--?

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:31.750
Oh, my!

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:32.790
Uh-oh!

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:36.540
Eek! A-A girl!

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:37.620
Huh?

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:41.330
Oh, I'm sorry. Could you excuse us for a moment?

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:43.450
S-Sure...

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.040
Oooh oooh!

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:48.290
Hifumi, it's all right now.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:49.700
She's gone?

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:53.250
Yep, thanks to the good doctor,
she's left the room.

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:56.540
Now would you get away from me? It's stifling.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:58.000
Ehehehe.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:00.660
So, what did you want to see me for?

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:03.750
Please stop by my place tonight,
if that's all right with you.

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:05.330
Since you've always been so good to me,

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:07.620
I'll do my best to fix you whatever you want!

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:11.330
Hmm... thank you.
I think I'll take you up on your offer.

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:12.750
Ehehe!

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:16.250
And Doppo? Did you merely
accompany Hifumi here today?

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:20.700
No... I came here seeking your advice.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:24.000
It's nothing but overtime, overtime,
overtime every single day at work.

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:27.540
No matter how much work I do,
my bald, old boss never appreciates me.

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:29.830
Instead, he always finds faults
and constantly lectures me...

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:34.540
Hehehehe... I bet that bald bastard
is using me as a tool to blow off steam...

00:18:34.540 --> 00:18:38.290
That's exactly what happened
that one time... I... I was...

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:41.370
Doppo, your bad habit is acting up.

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:44.200
Oh, I-I'm sorry...

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:48.750
If you work hard every day, your efforts
will be rewarded one day, I assure you.

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:51.330
So, you mustn't let things get you down.

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:53.830
Y-You're right... I'll try my best...

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:55.870
--Kyaaaaaaah!
--What the--?

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:57.910
Doctor! Please go somewhere safe.

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:02.080
Terrorists associated with the guy brought
in last night have taken a hostage!

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:07.620
"Shinjuku Central Hospital"

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:16.000
You have nowhere to run.
Surrender and do not resist!

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:20.080
We've got a hostage!
Free our comrade immediately!

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:21.950
And get a chopper ready while you're at it!

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:23.160
Grrr!

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:26.450
Cease this foolishness...

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:30.410
Who the fuck are you?
We're gonna change this corrupt society.

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:32.750
If you get in our way...

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.700
An illegal mic?!

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:43.370
Any ideal that is achieved by taking
hostages from among the weak is worthless!

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:00.620
♪ Pleas for salvation
Have conspicuous signs ♪

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:02.040
♪ Like tears in a child's eyes ♪

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:04.290
♪ From which we cannot avert our eyes
For we are Matenro ♪

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:06.040
♪ The stifling atmosphere oppressing those below ♪

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:07.080
♪ On and on it goes ♪

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:09.620
♪ Painted in rhyme and flow
The city's light and shadow ♪

00:20:09.620 --> 00:20:10.700
♪ Pandaemonium: Kabuki-cho ♪

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:12.290
♪ Unfamiliar intonations ♪

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:14.750
♪ In this land of iniquity
in its myriad variations ♪

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:15.370
♪ In this realm ♪

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:17.370
♪ You're Cinderella once the clock strikes twelve ♪

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:20.080
♪ Enjoying the likes of a regal
night sky in this interior wealth ♪

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:22.700
♪ There's a place for everyone
here on center stage ♪

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:23.750
♪ Helping one another is our domain ♪

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:25.370
♪ You're all my kittens and that'll never change ♪

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:26.660
♪ Opportunities for castigation
Opportunities from connections ♪

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:28.040
♪ It's lose-lose, no matter what you do ♪

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:30.660
♪ Don't let others feed on your decay
Don't let yourself rot away ♪

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:32.120
♪ It's judgement day
And I'm all outta luck ♪

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:33.330
♪ When it's a multi-car pile up
What's a guy to do? ♪

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.370
♪ You don't get to play the victim ♪

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:36.000
♪ When the one who hit that
fancy foreign car was you ♪

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:37.370
♪ Once a black market ♪

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:38.700
♪ Now plays the part ♪

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:39.950
♪ Of Tokyo's beating heart ♪

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:41.370
♪ That's Shinjuku town ♪

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:43.790
♪ A veritable melting pot of lives ♪

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:46.700
♪ Even if it's by mistake,
you'd best not break the rules ♪

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:48.080
♪ Once a black market ♪

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:49.370
♪ Now plays the part ♪

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:50.620
♪ Of Tokyo's beating heart ♪

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:52.040
♪ That's Shinjuku town ♪

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:54.410
♪ A veritable melting pot of tears ♪

00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:58.500
♪ Don't let the riffraff's
excuses make you the fool ♪

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:15.410
Thanks, you two.

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:18.040
Ehehe! No need to thank us!

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:22.000
Actually, I was worried that I was getting
in your way by being involved.

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:25.790
Heh, haha! Doppomine, how meek are you?

00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:28.200
Ow! Stop hitting me!

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:34.410
Unfortunately, I'll have to take
a rain check on visiting your home.

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:37.660
I've gone and personally added
some more patients to take care of.

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:45.160
This concludes my presentation
on the primary teams.

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:47.700
Thank you.

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:52.750
The division battle system is expected
to redirect the men's antipathy towards us

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:55.200
to their opposing teams instead.

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:59.790
Well, that's not the only reason
why the system exists.

00:22:01.120 --> 00:22:04.620
Hehehehe... It's about to begin...

00:22:04.620 --> 00:22:08.080
The performers we have
assembled are not only strong.

00:22:08.080 --> 00:22:11.620
Every single one of them
is also potentially dangerous.

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:17.580
It will be a pleasure to watch them clash
in the upcoming division battle.
